# expat: debian/libexpat1.install, debian/libexpat1-dev.install, debian/control
pkg libexpat1 usr/libilp32/libexpat.so.* usr/libilp32/libexpatw.so.*
pkg libexpat1-dev usr/aarch64-linux-gnu_ilp32/include/*.h usr/libilp32/*.a usr/libilp32/libexpat.so usr/libilp32/libexpatw.so usr/libilp32/cmake/** usr/libilp32/pkgconfig/expat.pc
dev-depends libexpat1-dev libc6-dev-ilp32
drop usr/bin/* -- the xmlwf program (Debian's expat package): no command line tools in the set
drop usr/share/** -- xmlwf's manual page and the documents
deviation configure --includedir=/usr/aarch64-linux-gnu_ilp32/include: all headers in the one ILP32 include directory (Debian: expat_config.h in /usr/include/<multiarch>, the others in /usr/include)
deviation the autotools-made cmake files (expat.cmake, expat-noconfig.cmake) assume libdir lib/<multiarch>; fixed after the install for /usr/libilp32: the prefix one directory less up, headers from the ILP32 include directory, the library relative to the prefix
